---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout title="Tentang AstroPro Digital" description="Tim multidisiplin yang membantu bisnis B2B membangun website Astro dan portal klien terpadu.">
        <section class="about">
                <div class="about__header">
                        <h1>Siapa Kami</h1>
                        <p>AstroPro Digital adalah tim strategis, desainer, dan engineer yang berfokus menghadirkan pengalaman digital premium melalui pendekatan data dan otomatisasi.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillars">
                        <article>
                                <h2>Strategi &amp; Operasi</h2>
                                <p>Memastikan value proposition jelas, alur portal efisien, dan KPI bisnis tercapai.</p>
                        </article>
                        <article>
                                <h2>Desain &amp; Pengalaman</h2>
                                <p>Design system terpadu, aksesibilitas WCAG 2.2 AA, dan copywriting konversi tinggi.</p>
                        </article>
                        <article>
                                <h2>Teknologi &amp; Keamanan</h2>
                                <p>Astro, Supabase, Cloudflare, serta praktik keamanan terstandarisasi untuk skala enterprise.</p>
                        </article>
                </div>
        </section>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
        .about {
                display: grid;
                gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
                padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
                border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
                background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(6, 12, 32, 0.82) 0%, rgba(17, 26, 48, 0.78) 60%, rgba(30, 40, 70, 0.85) 100%);
                border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
                box-shadow: 0 28px 60px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.55);
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
        }

        .about::before {
                content: '';
                position: absolute;
                inset: -30% 10% auto;
                height: 260px;
                background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.32), transparent 70%);
                opacity: 0.7;
                pointer-events: none;
        }

        .about::after {
                content: '';
                position: absolute;
                inset: 15% -40% -20% 40%;
                background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.28), transparent 70%);
                filter: blur(80px);
                opacity: 0.6;
                pointer-events: none;
        }

        .about__header {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                display: grid;
                gap: var(--space-3);
        }

        .about__header h1 {
                font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 2rem + 1vw, 3rem);
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--color-text-primary);
                text-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.25);
        }

        .about__header p {
                margin: 0;
                color: rgba(var(--text-secondary), 0.85);
                font-size: var(--text-lg);
                line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
        }

        .pillars {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                display: grid;
                gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        }

        article {
                background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(8, 12, 32, 0.85) 0%, rgba(17, 26, 48, 0.78) 100%);
                padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
                border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
                box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.55);
                border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
                transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base), border-color var(--transition-base);
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
        }

        article::before {
                content: '';
                position: absolute;
                inset: -25% -25% auto auto;
                width: 180px;
                height: 180px;
                background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3), transparent 65%);
                opacity: 0.7;
                pointer-events: none;
        }

        article:hover,
        article:focus-within {
                transform: translateY(-6px);
                box-shadow: var(--glow-secondary);
                border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.45);
        }

        article h2 {
                margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
                color: var(--color-text-primary);
                font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1.2rem + 0.4vw, 1.65rem);
        }

        article p {
                margin: 0;
                color: rgba(var(--text-secondary), 0.85);
                line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
                .about {
                        padding: var(--space-5);
                }

                .about__header h1 {
                        font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.75rem + 1.5vw, 2.6rem);
                }
        }
</style>
